        "TileImage": "$($repository 0cb9d334-99b3-4cab-9dba-6d7c3691a328).Image",
        "Description": "客户要求消灭安格斯和他助手，并在观察期投诉有家面馆的食物不干净，巧的是今晚他们也在此用餐，既然食物不干净，那为何不稍加利用一下呢？记得装备里自带三份毒药喔！\r\rWelcome back to Chongqing. Our customer asked us to eliminate ICA and his friends. During the observation period, the customer complained that the food in this noodle restaurant was not clean. Interestingly, the targets also ate noodles here tonight. Since the food was not clean, why not take advantage of this opportunity?\r\rTIP: There is no lethal poison in this map, you need to prepare three deadly poisons yourself.",
